    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0610" n="494" xml:id="pg494"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11776a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to certain American diplomatic
                        missions.</hi><anchor n="22" xml:id="d744-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Circular telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 29, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Mediators have notified the State Department that both Huerta and Carranza
                    have accepted the principle of mediation.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d744-f2"/> This
                    enables the Mediators to deal with the entire Mexican situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d744-f1" n="22" type="source" xml:id="d744-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the missions in Argentina, Austria-Hungary, Belgium, Brazil, Chile, Costa
                    Rica, Cuba, Denmark, France, Germany, Great Britain, Guatemala, Honduras, Italy,
                    Japan, Netherlands, Nicaragua, Norway, Paraguay, Peru, Portugal, Russia,
                    Salvador, Spain, Sweden and Uruguay.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d744-f2" n="23" xml:id="d744-f2-content">
                <p>As to Carranza’s attitude, see post, the inclosures with the Special
                    Commissioners’ despatch No. 8, May 31.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
